<title>UK: April Flotta to load 6.35 mln bbls in 11 cargoes.</title>
<headline>April Flotta to load 6.35 mln bbls in 11 cargoes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>April's U.K. North Sea Flotta crude programme will consist of 11 cargoes totalling 6.35 million barrels, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The March Flotta programme was for 6.05 million barrels in 10 cargoes.  </p>
<p>The traders said the April programme would be made up of seven cargoes of 600,000 barrels each, three of 500,000 barrels and one of 650,000 barrels.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
</text>
